Some ORM frameworks such as Hibernate use dedicated query languages, such as Hibernate Query Language (HQL), which may suffer from the same injection problems (HQL Injection):

```java
// UNSAFE: HQL injection!
Query unsafeHQLQuery = session.createQuery("from Inventory where productID='"+userSuppliedParameter+"'");
```

Parameterized queries are the recommended solution here as well:

```java
// Here is a safe version of the same query using named parameters
Query safeHQLQuery = session.createQuery("from Inventory where productID=:productid");
safeHQLQuery.setParameter("productid", userSuppliedParameter);
```

